Subject: app/session: model, cost and context window at a glance
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Desktop: the session header shows provider · model · effort · cost (the
composer's current selection; effort hidden at its default) in the turn meta's
style, left of the context circle. Hovering the circle shows the context %,
the window as used / max in pi's short form (8.1k / 1.0M) and where automatic
compaction starts, computed from the same compaction config as core.

Phone: the same circle sits in the Session/Changes/Files/Terminal row; a tap
opens every figure in a popover with the tooltip's look.

Ocelot-Patch: web/session-header-meta

